%% Title: From a position change to a routed hedge and its fills
sequenceDiagram
  participant Q as QuotingEngine
  participant R as RiskEngine
  participant H as Hedger
  participant HP as HedgePlanner and BoxQpSolver
  participant S as SmartOrderRouter
  participant A as Allocator and CostTable
  participant J as Journal via FrameSink
  participant B as ChildOrderBook
  participant V as Venue via OrderGateway
  participant HA as HedgeAnalytics

  Q->>R: onFill, client trade changes the position
  Note over R: ladder revalued for the instrument (Section 13.1)
  H->>R: onTimer: ladder plus working parents is the residual r
  alt one-day std dev of r below the trigger (10,000)
    H->>HA: recordResidual, episode ends
  else above the trigger
    H->>HP: plan(r)
    HP-->>H: lots per hedge instrument, FISTA to tolerance 1e-9
    H->>R: checkOrder, reserve the parent quantity
    H->>S: submit parent through HedgeOrderSink, bound at integration
    Note over H,S: first tranche 0.5 immediately, later tranches 1 - 2^(-dt / 30 s)
    S->>A: allocate the next slice across venues
    A-->>S: quantity per venue, aggressive or passive
    S->>J: RouteDecision (80) and RouteDecisionVenue (81) rows, before any child
    S->>V: newOrder, NewOrder (20) per child
    V-->>S: ExecutionReport (21) through ExecutionListener
    S->>B: apply the report, ChildOrderTransition (82) journaled
    Note over S,V: passive child cancelled at its horizon and re-routed aggressively, deadline routes everything
    S-->>H: parent fill, bound at integration
    H->>R: onHedgeFill: release, onFill
    H->>HA: slippage against the arrival mid
  end
